# Published research deliveries contain checksum-bound binary inputs and plots.
# Keep normal runtime/build/bytecode exclusions in effect everywhere else.
!artifacts/**/*.png
!artifacts/**/*.npz
!artifacts/**/*.h5
!artifacts/**/*.hdf5
